  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/0x4A4B\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8c29958e6c70946ccd00449f2da816bf7536178.png\" alt=\"横幅\"></a></p>\n<center><strong>适用于 Minecraft Java 版的 Seraphic PBR 材质包</strong></center>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>一款专为 Minecraft Java 版设计的 PBR 材质包。</p>\n<p>请注意，该材质包目前仍在开发中。如需获取完整且定期更新的版本，请考虑订阅我的 Patreon 页面。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>前置要求：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fseraphic-pbr\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></strong>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.irisshaders.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris Shaders Mod</a></strong>&nbsp;（用于着色器兼容）</li>\n<li>支持 PBR 功能的着色器包，例如&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fnostalgia-shader\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nostalgia Shaders</a></strong>&nbsp;、<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fseraphic-pbr\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSL Shaders</a></strong>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fkappa-shader%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kappa RT</a></strong>。</li>\n<li>我的推荐着色器包：由&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frre36.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">rre36</a>&nbsp;制作的&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fnostalgia-shader\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nostalgia Shaders</a></strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>条款与条件：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>分发：</strong>&nbsp;严格禁止重新分发、分享或转售本材质包。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>用户可修改 Seraphic PBR 材质包供个人使用，但严禁重新分发或上传任何版本。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>通过订阅我的 Patreon 页面来支持本材质包的开发，并抢先获取更新。享受更优质的画面，敬请期待更多更新！</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>社交账号：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/rpeQuq88Vr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"Youtube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube</a></strong></p>",
